period is assumed to be a function name. The named function is extracted. 
.RE
.RS 2.4i
.LP
\fR\fInumber\fI\fR\(emA numeric option is assumed to be a size. \
Functions containing approximately \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& or less \
statements are extracted. If both \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& and \fR\fI\
function\fI\fR\& are specified, then functions matching the given \
name(s) \fR\fIor\fI\fR\& meeting the size requirements, are extracted. 
