.LP
\fBevent\fR\fR\&[\fB\&=\fR\fR\&{ \fBauto\fR\fR\& | \fBmanual\fR\fR\
\& }]\(emEnable event tracing \&(automatically or manually, default \fB\
\&=auto\fR\fR\&).
.RE
.RS 2.4i
.LP
See the \fR\fIiPSC\*R/860\fI\fR\fR\fR\fR\fR\fR\fI\& Parallel Performance Analysis \
