.ta 1.2i 4.7i
.RS 1.2i
.HP 1.2i
\&2 	\h'-\w' 'u' All level 1 optimizations are performed. In addition, \
traditional scalar optimizations such as induction recognition and loop invariant motion are performed \
by the global optimizer. 
